{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "The Ocean gives back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "海洋会把它们还给你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thoughts gather into currents and resurface when they matter. Ask a question, and the Ocean answers from everything you have caught." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "灵感会聚成洋流，在合适的时刻再次浮现。向海洋提问，它会从你捕捉过的一切中作答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Ocean opens with a short introduction. Read it, then let it drift out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "海洋里备好了一条简短的介绍，读完之后，让它漂走就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Oryne is a quiet ocean for whatever crosses your mind. Capture a thought in text, voice, or an image, and it drifts in as a glowing mote. Thoughts that share a theme gather into currents like this one. Open a thought to grow it with a question, or ask across the whole Ocean from the Ask tab. Old thoughts resurface on their own when it matters, and the Library lays everything out when you want to browse. Seen enough? Clear these examples in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oryne 是一片安放灵感的海洋。用文字、语音或图片捕捉一个想法，它就会化作一点微光汇入海洋。主题相近的灵感会聚成一条条洋流，就像这一条。打开一条灵感，可以用一个问题把它延展下去；在提问页，则能向整片海洋发问。被时间冲远的灵感，会在合适的时刻再次浮现；想翻看时，库把一切都铺在那里。看完了？到设置里清空示例就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Oryne works" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oryne 怎么用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ideas arrive in the shower" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灵感总在洗澡时冒出来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "introduction" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "介绍"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you have seen how the Ocean works, the introduction can drift out. Your own thoughts stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看明白海洋怎么用之后，介绍就可以漂走了。你自己的灵感会留下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "" : {

    },
    "?" : {

    },
    "· %@" : {

    },
    "%lld" : {

    },
    "%lld fragments" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 个碎片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld thoughts drift here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "这里聚着 %lld 条灵感"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few words it goes by" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "给它起个名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few words, if needed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "想写几个字也行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh transcription will replace the transcript you edited. You can restore it afterwards." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新转写会替换你编辑过的文字记录，之后仍可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet sign the Ocean received it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "海洋收到时的轻声回应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reading list that only grows, never finishes. Maybe the point was never to finish, only to drift through." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一份只增不减、永远读不完的清单。也许重点从来不是读完，而是从中漫游而过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft chime and a gentle swell when a thought is released. The ring/silent switch quiets the chime." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灵感入海时,一声轻柔的音效,一阵温和的涌动。拨到静音时,音效也随之安静。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action Button" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "操作按钮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
